### List equipment

GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/request/Equipment

### Post equipment
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/request/Equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dell Laptop",
  "stock": 4
}

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/request/Requests


### Create request
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/request/Requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipment_ID": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "quantity": 2,
  "reason": "Needed for new employer"
}
